== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Drakes|Aggressive creature strategies#Drake}}

=== Spit cold ===
Fires three balls of ice at the player, inflicting the [[Frost (effect)|Frost]] effect (90 [[Damage types#Frost|Frost]] damage each). Each projectile travels at 15 meters per second for up to 10 seconds before despawning and has a spread of 10–20 degrees. This attack can be used within 5–15 meters of the player and has a 6-second cooldown.

